<tbody>
<tr><td>Format</td><td>16-section GHS format for the destination market</td></tr>
<tr><td>Product identity</td><td>Same name as the invoice, packing list and label</td></tr>
<tr><td>Supplier details</td><td>Your company's name, address and emergency phone number</td></tr>
<tr><td>Composition</td><td>Hazardous ingredients listed with CAS numbers and concentrations</td></tr>
<tr><td>Physical data</td><td>Key values, such as flash point, from tests or a CoA</td></tr>
<tr><td>Transport</td><td>Section 14 complete and correct for sea, air or road</td></tr>
<tr><td>Supporting documents</td><td>UN 38.3 test summary for lithium batteries</td></tr>
<tr><td>Revision date</td><td>Recent, and matching the current formulation</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

